    {
      "number": "681",
      "text": "681. \u6c42\u51fa\u4f7f\u4e0b\u5217\u7b49\u5f0f\u6210\u7acb\u7684 $x$ \u503c\uff1a\na) $2^x=(4^{-\\frac{1}{3}})^{12}\\cdot8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$\uff1b\nb) $3^x=(9^{-\\frac{1}{3}})^6\\cdot27^{0.5}$\u3002",
